    "result_text": "Full build passes. Summary of the change:\n\nThe owner JSON is produced by a MapStruct-generated DTO (`OwnerDto`), not the entity directly, so three small, low-complexity edits were needed:\n\n1. **`Person.java`** \u2014 added `getInitials()` plus a tiny private `initial(...)` helper. Person contains only trivial getters/setters (each CC 1), so this is a low-WMC, low-complexity spot to place the computation next to `firstName`/`lastName`.\n2. **`openapi.yml`** \u2014 declared a read-only `initials` property on the `Owner` schema so the generated DTO exposes the field.\n3. **`OwnerMapper.java`** \u2014 added one `@Mapping` line delegating `initials` to `owner.getInitials()`.\n\nNo existing method grew and no complex class was expanded \u2014 each change is a small cohesive unit. `AcceptanceTest.coreComputesInitials` now passes (`J.S.` for `john`/`smith`) and `BUILD SUCCESS`.",
